    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48623" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θήκ-η</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίθημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>case, chest</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσοῦ
			θ</span>. a money-<i>chest</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.130
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.83
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				1147
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				8.17
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>grave, tomb</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				405
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1763
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεκρῶν θήκας ἀνοίγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.187
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				67
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ θ. τῶν τεθνεώτων</span>”
