					Th.
					1.8
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				3.104
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἀναισχύντους θ. ἐτράποντο</span>
			<i>modes of burial</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.52
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				427b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θήκην ὀρύττειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					7.3.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξίφους θ</span>. sword-<i>sheath</i>,
